# Vulnerabilities Trivy must not fail the image job on (a known false
# positive). One entry per line, each preceded by a comment saying why it is
# safe to ignore and when to look again; for example:
#
#   # CVE-0000-00000: affects a feature the image does not use; recheck 2027-01.
#   CVE-0000-00000
#
# Empty on purpose: unfixed CVEs are already skipped (--ignore-unfixed).
